.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-SLOW 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-slow , rgoslow
.Nd find slow interfaces, paths, and transfer bottlenecks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm slow
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl a
.Op Fl n Ar filter
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl dest Ar hash
.Op Fl top Ar n
.Op Fl high-hop Ar n
.Op Fl m
.Op Fl I Ar duration
.Op Fl timeout Ar duration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Queries a running shared instance (Go
.Nm reticulum-go
or Python
.Nm rnsd )
over msgpack RPC and ranks congestion signals that commonly stall
resource transfers: bitrate caps, utilization, announce and path-request
bursts, held announces, bandwidth gates, socket RTT (Go), and high-hop
paths.
Against a Go daemon the report can also include local mesh health findings
such as integrity bursts, auth pressure, link degradation, and ingress
pressure. Counters stay on the node. This tool observes and scores only.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-timeout duration"
.It Fl config Ar dir
Config directory (default
.Pa ~/.reticulum-go ) .
.It Fl json
Emit JSON report.
.It Fl a
Include hidden and local peer interfaces.
.It Fl n Ar filter
Filter interfaces by name substring.
.It Fl l
Include active link count.
.It Fl dest Ar hash
Focus analysis on a destination (32 hex characters).
.It Fl top Ar n
Maximum interfaces to rank (default 12).
.It Fl high-hop Ar n
Hop count treated as high (default 6).
.It Fl m
Continuously refresh the report.
.It Fl I Ar duration
Monitor refresh interval (default 2s).
.It Fl timeout Ar duration
RPC timeout (default 10s).
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
rgoslow
rgoslow -config ~/.reticulum
rgoslow -dest 06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc
rgoslow -json -l
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-path 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-probe 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go 8
